uch a vile creature is beyond terrifying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T06:24:00-07:00","id":1545047,"title":"","content":"Sisters of the Cross. I haven\u2019t actually read the chapter yet, just finished the Storyguide chapter this morning. I just have a thing for supernatural hunting nuns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-30T06:49:49-07:00","id":1545049,"title":"","content":"Boring answer but grim a gameplay perspective I mostly appreciate that there's a good range of generic Accursed and Mortals.<br /> <br /> I'm very unlikely to want to use any specific named antagonist. I'm extremely likely to want generic cops or stats for a random vampire.<br /> <br /> (Also I'll drop this here too: I'm pretty sure that by RAW the Haint is almost totally non threatening).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-31T06:48